---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Block from "../components/Block.astro";
---

<Base
    title = "buh / about"
    description = "some more about me!"
>
    <Block class="font-light text-2xl noborder">
        <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl md:text-3xl text-fancy pulp">about buh</h1>
        <p>Currently studying computer science at the <span class="italic accent">Maria Curie-Skłodowska University</span> in Lublin.</p>
        <p>I have an interest in art as well as design, which I try to express here on my website!</p>
        <p class="italic opacity-80">Though, I am a little bit lazy, so I don't draw too often...</p>
        <br>
        <p>I find UI and web design fun, even made a few websites for people in the past, but I like to dip my toes in all sorts of other projects too.</p>
        <p>You can see a non-exhaustive list of my work on my <a href="/projects" class="accent-green">projects</a> page.</p>
    </Block>
    <Block class="font-light text-2xl noborder">
        <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl md:text-3xl text-fancy pulp">buhterests</h1>
        <p>I really like making stuff with my computer. Whether it's websites like this or old cringy meme montages I made with a pirated copy of Sony Vegas. I even dabbled in music as a kid, though that didn't really go anywhere.</p>
        <br>
        <p>I play all sorts of games, but I'm a huge fan of movement shooters specifically. I love a good story game too, I've been trying to catch up on some of the bigger singleplayer franchises that I missed out on. My most recent completion is the <b>Metal Gear Solid</b> series.</p>
        <br>
        <p>I also spend a bunch of time on <b>Final Fantasy XIV Online</b>, you can see more about my character <a href="/ffxiv" class="accent-green">here</a>.</p>
    </Block>
</Base>